    "salientSummary": "Implemented Job status monitor for Kubernetes evaluation tracking with state detection (Running/Completed/Failed), event capture and storage, DB/Redis updates on status changes, and OOM killed pod detection.",
    "whatWasImplemented": "Created Job status monitor package (internal/k8s/monitor/) with: Monitor struct for polling Job status via client-go at configurable intervals; detectJobState() to identify Running/Completed/Failed/Pending states; handleStateChange() to update DB and Redis on transitions; handleJobNotFound() for cleanup when Jobs are deleted; checkForOOMKilled() to detect OOM killed pods by exit code 137 or OOMKilled reason; EventStore interface with InMemoryEventStore for in-memory storage and DBLogStore for database persistence; JobEvent types (Created, Started, Completed, Failed, Deleted, OOMKilled); pod utilities (IsOOMKilled, GetExitCode, GetTerminationMessage, PodIsRunning, PodIsTerminated). Tests cover state detection, OOM detection, event storage, and monitor lifecycle.",
